// Keywords.
block circuit setup contract env const pub net let spec rated ensure within for in
// v0.1's keywords, until the parser stops reading them (syntax_v5_plan.md steps 3 and 4).
port assume
// Reserved.
use mod fn enum type trait impl if else match where as true false self super crate
signal interface family
// Names: contextual words, a keyword's other case, words that start like one, words
// no longer reserved (v5 writes a test bench as a `setup`, a parameter as a generic).
part from on In Out input _private r1_2 bench param
mode event observe emits with window at temp
